msgstr "研究玻尔兹曼分布的采样行为"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:57
msgid "The training objective combines two terms:"
msgstr "训练目标由两项组成："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:59
msgid ""
"**KL divergence**: encourages the model distribution to match the data "
"distribution (unsupervised generation)."
msgstr "**KL 散度**：鼓励模型分布与数据分布匹配（无监督生成）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:60
msgid ""
"**Non-contrastive loss (NCL)**: a conditional-consistency term that does not"
" require the free negative-phase sampling. When part of the visible units "
"are designated as outputs (`num_output`), the model must reconstruct those "
"outputs given the rest."
msgstr ""
"**非对比损失（NCL）**：一个无需自由负相采样的条件一致性项。当部分可见单元被指定为输出（`num_output`）时，模型必须在给定其余输入的条件下重建这些输出。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:62
msgid "The combined objective is:"
msgstr "组合目标为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{KL\\_divergence} + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{NCL}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{KL\\_divergence} + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{NCL}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:68
msgid "where $\\alpha$ is set via `cost_param[\"alpha\"]`."
msgstr "其中 $\\alpha$ 由 `cost_param[\"alpha\"]` 控制，平衡生成能力与条件一致性。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:70
msgid ""
"The `num_output` parameter designates which visible units are \"outputs\" "
"(e.g. labels in a supervised setting), enabling conditional generation — you"
" can fix part of the visible units and let the model generate the rest."
msgstr "`num_output` 参数指定哪些可见单元为\"输出\"（如监督设定中的标签），实现条件生成——您可以固定部分可见单元，让模型生成其余部分。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:73
msgid "Sampling Phases"
msgstr "采样阶段"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:75
msgid ""
"**Negative phase**: `bm_net.sample(worker)` draws a complete joint "
"visible+hidden state from the current BM distribution, approximating the "
"model distribution for the contrastive divergence objective."
msgstr ""
"**负相**：`bm_net.sample(worker)` 从当前 BM 分布中采样完整的联合可见+隐状态，用于近似对比散度目标中的模型分布。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:77
msgid "**Positive phase**: two conditional samplings per batch:"
msgstr "**正相**：每个批次执行两类条件采样："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:79
msgid ""
"**Full conditional**: the entire input batch is fixed as the visible layer, "
"and the corresponding joint state is sampled."
msgstr "**完整条件**：将整个输入批次固定为可见层，采样对应的联合状态。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:80
msgid ""
"**Partial conditional**: only the non-output portion of the input (`data[:, "
":-num_output]`) is fixed, and the output dimensions are sampled freely."
msgstr "**部分条件**：仅固定输入的非输出部分（`data[:, :-num_output]`），输出维度自由采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:82
msgid ""
"Together they provide the positive-phase statistics. The KL term contrasts "
"these with the negative-phase free sample (`state_all`). The NCL term "
"instead measures an energy consistency between the two positive-phase "
"states, with the output columns zeroed — it needs no negative-phase "
"sampling."
msgstr ""
"两者共同提供正相统计。KL 项将它们与负相自由采样（`state_all`）对比。NCL "
"项则衡量两个正相状态之间的能量一致性（输出列置零）——它无需负相采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:84
msgid ""
"All sampling runs on multiple workers: each batch is split across processes,"
" so the two conditional samplings proceed in parallel. A cosine schedule "
"with linear warmup stabilizes early training. All sampling operations stay "
"inside the PyTorch computation graph, enabling end-to-end backpropagation."
msgstr ""
"所有采样都在多个 worker 上运行：每个批次按进程切分，两个条件采样并行执行。带线性 warmup 的余弦调度稳定训练初期。所有采样操作都嵌入 "
"PyTorch 计算图，支持端到端反向传播。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:86
msgid ""
"The sampler abstraction used here, i.e., swap SA ↔ CIM without touching the "
"rest of the pipeline, is introduced in [Integrating Quantum Samplers into "
"PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)."
msgstr ""
"此处使用的采样器抽象，即在不改动流水线其余部分的前提下在 SA ↔ CIM 之间切换，在[将量子采样器集成到 "
"PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)中介绍。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:88
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:90
msgid ""
"The steps below condense `example/bm_generation/train_bm.ipynb` with imports"
" omitted; the notebook is the fully runnable walkthrough."
msgstr ""
"以下步骤浓缩自 `example/bm_generation/train_bm.ipynb`，省略了 import；该 notebook "
"即完整可运行的演练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:92
msgid ""
"**1. Build the sampler.** Use simulated annealing (SA) for local debugging; "
"for quantum hardware, swap in a `CIMOptimizer` wrapped in "
"`PrecisionReducer`, the rest of the pipeline stays unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**1. 构建采样器。** 本地调试使用模拟退火（SA）；接入量子硬件时，换成经 `PrecisionReducer` 包装的 "
"`CIMOptimizer`——流水线其余部分保持不变。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:101
msgid ""
"**2. Wrap the data.** `CSVDataset` takes a numpy array shaped `(num_columns,"
" num_rows)` and `DataLoader` provides batching."
msgstr ""
"**2. 封装数据。** `CSVDataset` 接收形状为 `(num_columns, num_rows)` 的 numpy "
"数组，`DataLoader` 负责分批。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:108
msgid ""
"**3. Initialize the trainer.** `Trainer` requires three positional "
"arguments, `(data, saver, worker)`: the dataloader, a `Saver` for "
"checkpoints and loss logs, and the sampler. `num_output` designates the "
"trailing visible units used by the conditional (NCL) term; here it is `0`, "
"so this run is pure unsupervised generation (see How It Works above)."
msgstr ""
"**3. 初始化训练器。** `Trainer` 需要三个位置参数——`(data, saver, "
"worker)`：数据加载器、用于保存检查点与损失日志的 `Saver`，以及采样器。`num_output` "
"指定用于条件（NCL）项的尾部可见单元；此处为 `0`，因此本次运行为纯无监督生成（见上文工作原理）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:116
msgid ""
"**4. Set the hyperparameters.** Learning rates go through "
"`set_learning_parameters`; the KL / NCL balance goes through "
"`set_cost_parameter`, where `alpha` weights the KL term against the NCL "
"term. `beta` is accepted for API compatibility but is not used by the "
"current objective."
msgstr ""
"**4. 设置超参数。** 学习率通过 `set_learning_parameters` 设置；KL / NCL 的平衡通过 "
"`set_cost_parameter` 设置——`alpha` 控制 KL 项相对 NCL 项的权重。`beta` 仅用于 API "
"兼容，当前目标函数不使用它。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:123
msgid ""
"**5. Train.** Training counts steps rather than epochs; `num_processes` "
"parallelizes the positive-phase conditional sampling across workers."
msgstr "**5. 训练。** 训练按步数而非轮数（epoch）计数；`num_processes` 将正相条件采样并行到多个进程。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:129
msgid ""
"After training, `sample_bm.ipynb` loads the checkpoint, samples joint "
"visible+hidden states with the same sampler, deduplicates them, and compares"
" the visible slice with the training data via PCA."
msgstr ""
"训练结束后，`sample_bm.ipynb` 加载检查点，用同一采样器采样完整的可见+隐藏联合状态，去重后通过 PCA 将可见层切片与训练数据对比。"

