msgstr "**生成样本**：将生成样本的分布与原始数据对比（`sample_bm.ipynb` 中的直方图/散点图）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:178
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "小结"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:180
msgid ""
"A BM drops the bipartite restriction, enabling arbitrary dependencies but "
"requiring sequential sampling."
msgstr "BM 去除了二部图限制，可建模任意依赖关系，但需要顺序采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:181
msgid ""
"The training objective mixes KL divergence (generation) and NCL term "
"(conditional reconstruction), controlled by `alpha`."
msgstr "训练目标混合 KL 散度（生成）与 NCL（条件重建），由 `alpha` 控制权重。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:182
msgid ""
